{"step_index":1463,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-26T12:36:36Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-26T12:36:36Z\nCompleted At: 2026-10-26T12:36:36Z\nThe tool's output was truncated due to being too long. You can find the full output in a file at file:///home/jeremy/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/952bc719-abd2-42eb-a14d-385b181c96ff/.system_generated/steps/1463/output.txt.\n\nHere is a preview with the middle of the output truncated:\nCommand exited with code 0.\n\nCommand output:\ncommit 118bd9067a2ec043a62ce4aa78316c497ab2e3fc\r\nAuthor: Jeremy Hobson <jeremy@3tched.com>\r\nDate:   Fri Oct 2 20:29:43 2026 +0000\r\n\r\n    feat(op-cozo-store): add proper migration helper for chatbot physical root\r\n    \r\n    Add migrate-chatbot-root utility that guides through the proper atomic\r\n    migration procedure for moving chatbot identity from loop images to the\r\n    shared physical seed device (/dev/sdb2).\r\n    \r\n    Three-step migration process:\r\n    1. preflight: Get current state via inspect_own_physical_root_migration_preflight\r\n    2. prepare: Create migration plan JSON with all required fields and SHA256\r\n    3. migrate: Call migrate_own_physical_root with plan SHA256\r\n    \r\n    This follows the official procedure from the identity migration receipt:\r\n      reports/identity-replacement/20260930/cozo-reconciliation/receipt.md\r\n    \r\n    The utility provides detailed guidance on:\r\n    - Required authenticated D-Bus access (lungs.sock or SID1)\r\n    - Necessary capabilities (cap.identity.sled.physical_root_migrate@v1)\r\n    - Plan JSON structure and all required fields\r\n    - Verification steps after migration\r\n    \r\n    This is a safe, atomic operation that preserves all identity metadata\r\n    while updating the physical storage binding to use /dev/sdb2.\r\n\r\ndiff --git a/crates/op-cozo-store/Cargo.toml b/crates/op-cozo-store/Cargo.toml\r\nindex 2d2655b..14bfaa5 100755\r\n--- a/crates/op-cozo-s